    [1,'meaning','用法','“Imagine a world without traffic” asks you to _____.',['form a picture or idea in your mind','ignore a traffic sign','identify a driver'],'form a picture or idea in your mind','第一义项是想象、设想。'],[2,'meaning','语境','“I imagine the shop is closed” means “I _____ the shop is closed.”',['suppose','prove','imitate'],'suppose','imagine 可表示猜想或认为。'],[3,'meaning','语境','If you are imagining things, you are thinking of events that _____.',['are not actually true','have been officially identified','are immediately happening'],'are not actually true','口语表达 imagining things 指把不存在的事当成真的。'],[1,'grammar','句型','Choose a natural completion: “Can you imagine _____ abroad?”',['living','to live','live'],'living','imagine 后常接动名词表示设想某种经历。']
