    [1,'meaning','词义','An imminent storm is one that is _____.',['likely to happen very soon','already over','not expected ever'],'likely to happen very soon','imminent 表示很快就会发生。'],[2,'meaning','语境','A business facing imminent collapse may collapse _____.',['at any moment','only after many years','because it is immune'],'at any moment','第二义强调危机近在眼前、随时可能发生。'],[1,'distinction','拼写辨析','Which word means “about to happen”?',['imminent','eminent','immense'],'imminent','imminent 表示即将发生；eminent 表示杰出的。'],[1,'collocation','搭配','Residents were warned of _____ danger from the unstable cliff.',['imminent','immediate family','immaterial'],'imminent','imminent danger 是常见搭配。']
