    [1,'meaning','语境','An implicit warning is understood even though it is _____.',['not stated directly','written in large letters','physically contained in a box'],'not stated directly','第一义项是含蓄或不言明的。'],[2,'meaning','搭配','If a requirement is implicit in the plan, it is _____ the plan.',['contained as a necessary part of','excluded by law from','unrelated to'],'contained as a necessary part of','第二义项表示内含于某事物。'],[3,'meaning','语境','Implicit trust is complete trust that is _____.',['unquestioning','only temporary and doubtful','kept secret from everyone'],'unquestioning','第三义项可表示绝对的、毫不怀疑的。'],[1,'distinction','辨析','Implicit criticism is hinted at; explicit criticism is _____.',['stated clearly','imagined but unreal','about to happen'],'stated clearly','explicit 与 implicit 相对，表示明确说出。']
