    [1,'meaning','词义','A country imports goods when it _____ them from abroad.',['brings them in','sends them overseas','copies them by hand'],'brings them in','动词 import 指从国外运入商品或服务。'],[2,'meaning','词性','Cheap imports are products that have been _____.',['brought in from another country','made illegal locally','used as tools'],'brought in from another country','imports 作复数名词可指进口商品。'],[3,'meaning','语境','The import of fuel refers to the act or business of ____ fuel.',['bringing in','explaining','hitting'],'bringing in','第三义项指进口这一行为或业务。'],[4,'meaning','语体','In “a matter of great import,” import means great _____.',['importance or significance','quantity of imported goods','physical impact'],'importance or significance','正式用法中 import 可表示重要性或含义。']
